"""Persian copy.

Every multi-line screen starts its lines with a right-to-left mark (\u200f).
Telegram aligns a line by its first strong character, so a line that opens with
an emoji or a latin word jumps to the left and drags the layout apart. The mark
keeps the whole screen properly right aligned on every client.
"""

